{
 "description": "The registration import's format (controller/atalaia_controller/import_format.py, which the site server re-exports; app/lib/controller/registration_import.dart is its port; PKE-1). Each case gives a file ('data' text, 'data_hex' bytes, or 'data_gen': head + unit x times + tail), its 'format' and the game's 'rules' (the top-level ones unless the case gives its own, merged over them); 'expect' is either {'error': code, 'line'?} (the file is refused whole) or the parse (format, columns, ignored, ignored_more) and, per row, its number and either the code it is refused with or the checked values (display_name, external_ref, team_preference, federation_number, replicas (null: no column), present (the columns the file had, sorted), warnings). 'expect' of a generated file has only a row_count. Cases whose names start with 'csv:' or 'json:' parse; 'refused' ones are refused whole. Python's csv module (strict, excel dialect) is the reference for the CSV reader.",
 "rules": {
  "teams": [
   "red",
   "blue"
  ],
  "federation": "optional",
  "predeclare_replicas": true,
  "classes": [
   "dmr",
   "pistol",
   "rifle",
   "sniper"
  ],
  "max_replicas": 3
 },
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "csv: RFC 4180 records (commas, quotes, line breaks)",
   "format": "csv",
   "data": "display_name,external_ref,team_preference,federation_number,replicas\r\n\"Falcão, o Velho\",ref-1,red,FPA-1,\"aeg:rifle:Tokyo Marui M4|pistol:pistol\"\r\n\"Diz \"\"Lobo\"\"\",ref-2,,,\r\n\"Duas\r\nlinhas\",ref-3,blue,,\r\n",
   "expect": {
    "format": "csv",
    "columns": [
     "display_name",
     "external_ref",
     "team_preference",
     "federation_number",
     "replicas"
    ],
    "ignored": [],
    "ignored_more": 0,
    "rows": [
     {
      "number": 2,
      "result": {
       "display_name": "Falcão, o Velho",
       "external_ref": "ref-1",
       "team_preference": "red",
       "federation_number": "FPA-1",
       "replicas": [
        {
         "type": "aeg",
         "class": "rifle",
         "make_model": "Tokyo Marui M4"
        },
        {
         "type": "pistol",
         "class": "pistol",
         "make_model": null
        }
       ],
       "present": [
        "display_name",
        "external_ref",
        "federation_number",
        "replicas",
        "team_preference"
       ],
       "warnings": []
      }
     },
     {
      "number": 3,
      "result": {
       "display_name": "Diz \"Lobo\"",
       "external_ref": "ref-2",
       "team_preference": null,
       "federation_number": null,
       "replicas": [],
       "present": [
        "display_name",
        "external_ref",
        "federation_number",
        "replicas",
        "team_preference"
       ],
       "warnings": []
      }
     },
     {
      "number": 4,
      "result": "display_name_invalid"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
